      en: ["Founded in 1856", "Center of Amur Oblast", "Border city with China", "Important commercial hub"],
      es: ["Fundada en 1856", "Capital del óblast de Amur", "Ciudad fronteriza con China", "Ubicación comercial importante"],
      pt: ["Fundada em 1856", "Centro do Oblast de Amur", "Cidade fronteiriça com a China", "Local de comércio importante"],
