      en: ["Blagoveshchensk was founded in 1856 during the Russian expansion south.", "It is the administrative center of the Amur Oblast.", "The city is separated from China only by the width of the Amur River.", "It was granted city status in 1858 following the Treaty of Aigun.", "The Trans-Siberian Railway connects to the city via a branch line.", "A bridge now connects Blagoveshchensk directly to Heihe, China."],
