      en: ["Tobolsk was founded in 1587 by Cossacks under the command of Danila Chulkov.", "The Tobolsk Kremlin is the only stone kremlin located in Siberia.", "Dmitri Mendeleev, the inventor of the periodic table, was born here in 1834.", "Tsar Nicholas II and his family lived here in exile from August 1917 to April 1918.", "The city served as the capital of the Siberian Governorate until 1822.", "The monument to Yermak Timofeyevich commemorates the conqueror of Siberia."],
